            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Turns any freeform surface into a roof structure: a two-way grid of deep ribs follows the surface's U and V directions, and every bay between ribs gets a pair of crossing diagonal braces at the top of the ribs.</item>
            <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">structure-shell-roof-ribs.harnessed.ghx</item>
          </items>
