                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Two Range components split the surface domain 0..1 into equal steps. Construct Point combines them into UV points, and Iso Curve draws the U and V curves through each point. Each curve is extruded straight up by Unit Z x Rib depth, giving vertical rib plates that follow the roof.</item>
