                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Divide Domain2 cuts the same domain into U x V cells and Isotrim turns each cell into a small sub-surface (a bay). Deconstruct Brep gives each bay's four corner points; List Item picks corners 0-2 and 1-3 so two Lines cross the bay. The lines are moved up by the rib depth and piped into round braces.</item>
                  </items>
